'''Parthenon''' (パルテノン神殿, ''Parutenon Shinden'', '''Parthenon Temple''') is the 15th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.1 Update|Version 2.1]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is the 8th sub-chapter in the Stories of Legend and is available up to 3★ difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Certainly more difficult than the past few sub-chapters, and the sub-chapters after this are quite hard as well. The hardest stage here is [[Labyrinth of Hades]], because of the synergy between [[Kory]] and [[Bun Bun Black]]. For the fourth stage, [[Dawn of Gaia]], the player will need a [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitter]], like [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]], [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat]] or [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]].
{{LegendDiff|150|200|200}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces two new enemies:
*[[Metal One Horn]]: A [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of [[One Horn]] with insanely fast attacks, and more health than [[Metal Hippoe]].
*[[Bun Bun Black]]: A [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Teacher Bun Bun]] with much more health than the original, but slower movement speed and lower damage.

