==Trivia==
*The [[wikipedia:Parthenon|Parthenon]] is an ancient Greek temple that was devoted to the Greek goddess [[wikipedia:Athena|Athena]].
*Each stage of Parthenon is named after a famous figure in Greek mythology, such as [[wikipedia:Achilles|Achilles]] and [[wikipedia:Eros|Eros]]. Four of them ([[Thunder God Zeus (Uber Rare Cat)|Zeus]], [[Gaia the Creator (Legend Rare Cat)|Gaia]], [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Aphrodite]] and [[Hades the Punisher (Uber Rare Cat)|Hades]]) are included in [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties Majestic Zeus]] Uber Rare set.
*The stages of this sub-chapter are basically [[Western Street]] stages with higher buffs:
**Altar of Zeus: [[Gunman's Dawn]]
**Sword of Achilles: [[Cowboy Haven]]
**Road of Eros: [[Wanted Night]]
**Dawn of Gaia: [[Macaroni Town]] ([[Metal Hippoe]] is replaced with [[Metal One Horn]])
**Gates of Aphrodite: [[Wandering Traveler]]
**Labyrinth of Hades isn't a direct remake of [[Rodeo Night]] like the others, but similarly introduces a [[Bun Bun Black|variant]] of [[Teacher Bun Bun]] as a boss after the enemy base reaches 99% HP.
*This is the first [[Stories of Legend]] sub-chapter where 4-crown difficulty is only 200% (the same as in 3-crown), rather than 300% like in all the previous sub-chapters.
*One of the possible endings for [[Gamatoto Expedition]] log messages is "at the Parthenon."

